  "notes": "MTC UK 2K Android TV (codename tabata), Android TV 11, firmware RTO8.250807.002, MediaTek m5621\nShares its firmware family with JVC UK sets (android.autoinstalls.config.JVC is present).\n\nApply:   TV_HOST=<tv ip> tools/disable.sh examples/mtc-uk-2k-android-tv/debloat.txt\nUndo:    TV_HOST=<tv ip> tools/restore.sh examples/mtc-uk-2k-android-tv/debloat.txt\nEverything is DISABLED, not uninstalled. Comment out any line you want to keep.\n\nQuirks: dumpsys is crippled on this firmware (\"Service dumps disabled due to hung\nsystem process\") - verify with pm list packages -d and screenshots, not dumpsys.\nThe stock launcher is com.google.android.tvlauncher (Android TV leanback, not Google TV\nlauncherx), so restore.sh needs no launcher argument.\nGoogle launcher ad/recommendation services (launcher itself is disabled by build-and-install.sh)",
